# Normalize line endings: store everything as LF in the repo, let Git
# convert to native on checkout where it matters. Stops Windows + Linux
# contributors from generating phantom whole-file diffs whenever a tool
# (sed, IDE, formatter) flips line endings. One-time normalization was
# applied as part of #68; from here on, the index is authoritative.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat known binary types as binary (don't touch them)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.class binary
